<title>USA: Omaha hogs $1.00 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs $1.00 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were mostly $1.00 lower. Top $60.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US  1-3   220-260 lbs    59.50-60.00, numerous 59.50</p>
<p>US  2-3   260-280 lbs    58.50-59.00</p>
<p>Sows: 20 percent. 0.50 to mostly 1.00 lower. Top 50.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    350-450 lbs    47.00-47.25</p>
<p>	    450-500 lbs    47.50-48.00</p>
<p>US 2-3    500-650 lbs    49.00-50.00</p>
</text>
